BODY:R1 and R6 (the populated checks accepted semantically empty data). The migration is edited in
place, since it has shipped nowhere and the local stack replays from empty.
  * The scalar CHECKs on github_handle and contribution_summary become `!~ '^\s*$'`. btrim's
