100: > "Enabling manual identity linking without an unlink guard does not preserve the specification's
101: > 'no unlinked volunteer accounts' invariant after signup." *(high, unverified-runtime-claim: yes)*
102: >
103: > "An email- or Google-established volunteer has multiple identities after linking GitHub; if
